    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as Jesus was going up to Jerusalem, he took the twelve disciples apart, and on the way he said unto them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, we go up to Jerusalem; and the Son of man shall be delivered unto the chief priests and scribes; and they shall condemn him to death, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and shall deliver him unto the Gentiles to mock, and to scourge, and to crucify: and the third day he shall be raised up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then came to him the mother of the sons of Zebedee with her sons, worshipping ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and asking a certain thing of him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto her, What wouldest thou? She saith unto him, Command that these my two sons may sit, one on thy right hand, and one on thy left hand, in thy kingdom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus answered and said, Ye know not what ye ask. Are ye able to drink the cup that I am about to drink? They say unto him, We are able. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He saith unto them, My cup indeed ye shall drink: but to sit on my right hand, and on ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " left hand, is not mine to give; but ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for whom it hath been prepared of my Father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the ten heard it, they were moved with indignation concerning the two brethren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus called them unto him, and said, Ye know that the rulers of the Gentiles lord it over them, and their great ones exercise authority over them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not so shall it be among you: but whosoever would become great among you shall be your minister; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and whosoever would be first among you shall be your servant: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even as the Son of man came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as they went out from Jericho, a great multitude followed him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, two blind men sitting by the way side, when they heard that Jesus was passing by, cried out, saying, Lord, have mercy on us, thou son of David. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the multitude rebuked them, that they should hold their peace: but they cried out the more, saying, Lord, have mercy on us, thou son of David. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus stood still, and called them, and said, What will ye that I should do unto you? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They say unto him, Lord, that our eyes may be opened. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus, being moved with compassion, touched their eyes; and straightway they received their sight, and followed him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
